 "appinfo.version": "Verżjoni",
 "plist.NSHealthShareUsageDescription": "Liftr jaqra l-piż, il-kompożizzjoni tal-ġisem u r-rata tal-qalb tiegħek biex juri l-progress tiegħek.",
 "plist.NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription": "Liftr jissalva t-taħriġiet tal-gym, il-kaloriji u l-piż tiegħek f'Apple Health.",
 "plist.NSCameraUsageDescription": "Liftr juża l-kamera biex jiskennja l-kodiċi QR jew il-barcode tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek.",
 "plist.NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription": "Liftr jaqra l-kodiċi tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek minn screenshot li tagħżel int.",
 "Edit text": "Editja t-test",
 "1M": "1X",
 "3M": "3X",
 "6M": "6X",
 "1Y": "1S",
 "No data in this period.": "L-ebda data f'dan il-perjodu.",
 "Min": "Min",
 "Average": "Medja",
 "Max": "Mass",
 "Your data stays yours": "Id-data tiegħek tibqa' tiegħek",
 "Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.": "Liftr m'għandux kont, m'għandux server u m'għandux reklami. It-taħriġiet, l-eżerċizzji, ir-rutini, il-kejl tal-ġisem u l-pass tal-gym tiegħek jinħażnu fuq l-apparat tiegħek u fl-iCloud privat tiegħek.",
 "Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.": "Biss bil-permess tiegħek, Liftr jaqra l-piż, il-kompożizzjoni tal-ġisem u r-rata tal-qalb waqt il-mistrieħ tiegħek, u jsalva t-taħriġiet, il-kaloriji, id-distanza u l-piż. Id-data tas-saħħa qatt ma titlaq mill-apparati tiegħek permezz ta' Liftr u qatt ma tintuża għar-reklami. Tista' tbiddel l-aċċess fi kwalunkwe ħin fl-app Apple Health.",
 "iCloud": "iCloud",
 "Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.": "Is-sinkronizzazzjoni bejn l-iPhone, l-iPad u l-Apple Watch tiegħek issir permezz tad-database privata tiegħek ta' iCloud. L-iżviluppatur ma jistax jara din id-data. Il-kodiċi tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek huwa kriptat minn tarf għal tarf.",
 "Camera and photos": "Kamera u ritratti",
 "The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.": "Il-kamera u r-ritratti tiegħek jintużaw biss biex jinqara l-kodiċi tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek. L-istampi ma jiġux issejvjati u ma jintbagħtu imkien.",
 "Notifications": "Notifiki",
 "Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.": "It-tfakkiriet u t-timer tal-mistrieħ jiġu ppjanati fuq l-apparat tiegħek. M'hemmx server tal-push.",
 "No tracking": "L-ebda traċċar",
 "Liftr contains no analytics, no third-party code and no tracking of any kind.": "Liftr ma fih l-ebda analitika, l-ebda kodiċi ta' partijiet terzi u l-ebda tip ta' traċċar.",
 "Deleting your data": "Tħassir tad-data tiegħek",
 "Delete workouts in the app. To remove everything, delete Liftr and remove its data in Settings → your name → iCloud → Manage Storage.": "Ħassar it-taħriġiet fl-app. Biex tneħħi kollox, ħassar lil Liftr u neħħi d-data tiegħu minn Settings → ismek → iCloud → Manage Storage.",
 "Privacy": "Privatezza",
 "Liftr is built to keep your training private.": "Liftr inbena biex iżomm it-taħriġ tiegħek privat.",
 "Questions?": "Mistoqsijiet?",
 "Last updated: November 2026": "L-aħħar aġġornament: Novembru 2026",
 "Waiting for internet": "Qed nistenna l-internet",
 "iCloud storage is full": "L-ispazju tal-iCloud mimli",
 "iCloud isn't set up yet": "L-iCloud għadu mhux issettjat",
 "iCloud is busy. Liftr tries again automatically; your workouts are safe on this device.": "L-iCloud okkupat. Liftr jerġa' jipprova awtomatikament; it-taħriġiet tiegħek huma sikuri fuq dan l-apparat.",
 "Your workouts sync as soon as you're online again.": "It-taħriġiet tiegħek jissinkronizzaw hekk kif terġa' tkun online.",
 "Free up space in iCloud to keep syncing. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Agħmel spazju fl-iCloud biex tkompli tissinkronizza. It-taħriġiet tiegħek huma sikuri fuq dan l-apparat.",
 "This version of Liftr can't save to iCloud yet. Your workouts are safe on this device and sync once this is fixed.": "Din il-verżjoni ta' Liftr għadha ma tistax tissejvja fl-iCloud. It-taħriġiet tiegħek huma sikuri fuq dan l-apparat u jissinkronizzaw hekk kif dan jissewwa.",
 "Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Liftr jerġa' jipprova aktar tard. It-taħriġiet tiegħek huma sikuri fuq dan l-apparat.",
 "Tap for technical details": "Agħfas għad-dettalji tekniċi",
